<html><head><title>4th Torch</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="4_Teacher_files/teachertrail04.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                 <h3 style="margin-top:14.05pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:14.05pt;
margin-left:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;color:windowtext;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">HOW</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></h3><h1 style="font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Participate: out of personal drive, join
initiatives<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">As a teacher, you can participate in
transdisciplinary education in various ways. You can be an initiator, join an
ongoing project, serve as an expert, work as a teacher-researcher, or play a
supporting role.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-US">Currently, much transdisciplinary education starts
with individual, enthusiastic teachers who set up a project with a strong
interest and belief in innovative education. They seek broader support within
their institution. Teachers thus function as the pioneers.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-US">Now that more transdisciplinary education
projects are emerging everywhere, you can also join existing initiatives or
collaborate with other partners. Institution-wide educational events, such as
an annual day or education festival, or national education conferences, are
good opportunities to connect with other motivated innovators. The same applies
to network organizations like Comenius (in het Netherlands) or networking via
social media like LinkedIn. Also, look around within your own university for
ongoing initiatives, or at other schools in the region.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-US">Sometimes, companies and societal organizations
themselves approach educational institutions with project proposals. It helps
to actively express your interest in developing transdisciplinary education, to
increase the chances of being connected to other enthusiasts.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
12.0pt;margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-bidi-font-family:
Aptos;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">There are many different ways to engage in
transdisciplinary education. Throughout the TRAIL, you will learn more about
the various phases of transdisciplinary education. Whether you are pioneering
alone or joining an existing initiative.</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p></h1><p style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"></p></body></html>